       "text": "Google rarely puts their best possible offer on the table in the first round"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 402,
       "endIndex": 507,
       "text": "Google standardly uses a **front-loaded vesting schedule** (33% / 33% / 22% / 12%) for initial GSU grants"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       4
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 600,
       "endIndex": 660,
       "text": "| **Base Salary** | $240,000 | $235,000 *(Range max: $271k)*"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 663,
       "endIndex": 718,
       "text": "| **Target Bonus** | ~$36,000 *(15%)* | $47,000 *(20%)*"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 837,
       "endIndex": 925,
       "text": "| **Year 1 Equity Vest** | ~$200,000 *(Upcoming 12 mo)* | **$356,400** *(33% of $1.08M)*"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       4
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1100,
       "endIndex": 1304,
       "text": "**Year 1 & 2 Upside:** Due to Google\u2019s 33/33/22/12 front-loaded schedule, your actual Year 1 and Year 2 compensation will be ~**$638k/yr**, providing an immediate ~$112k/yr boost over your Meta run rate"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       4
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1309,
       "endIndex": 1410,
       "text": "**The \"Year 3 Cliff\":** In Years 3 and 4, your initial grant drops to $237.6k (22%) and $129.6k (12%)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       4
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1412,
       "endIndex": 1564,
       "text": "Google relies on annual refreshers to fill this gap, but as the recruiter noted, refreshers depend on company performance cycles and manager calibration"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3823,
       "endIndex": 3987,
       "text": "**Retirement Match:** Google offers a 50% match on 401(k) contributions up to the IRS maximum with immediate vesting, alongside access to Mega Backdoor Roth options"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       5
      ]
     }
